5250	<h4 style="margin:10px 0 4px">Windways</h4>
5251	<div class="sk-bx sk-talk" style="text-align:center"><h3>End of Chapter 2: "Rusty Windmill Isles"</h3><p>As the Creaking Warden fell, the great windmill that had been turning backwards faltered, then slowly began to turn the right way.</p><p>One by one, the isles' windmills follow. The wind now flows toward Anchored Harbor — where the airships lie moored.</p><p style="font-size:13px;color:#8a7458">⟨0⟩ Lv ⟨1⟩ · Murklings defeated ⟨2⟩ · Played ⟨3⟩ min<br>Cross to Chapter 3, Anchored Harbor, from the "Windways" at the Pinwheel Beacon (travel).</p><button class="sk-b p" data-a="x">Keep exploring</button></div>
5252	Salt Fluffling
5253	A fluffling crusted with dried sea salt. Swarms in, stinging.
5254	Barnacle Pod
5255	A pod covered in barnacles. Charges from afar.
5256	Grumpy Gull
5257	A gull that perches on moored airship masts, then dives in flocks.
5258	Anchor Crab
5259	A crab with a giant anchor-shaped claw. Swings it around when you get close (watch the floor marker and dodge).
5260	Barnacle Nestkeeper
5261	A nestkeeper armored in barnacles. Nests on every wharf, hoarding rope coils.
5262	Rusty Airship
5263	An old airship once moored in the harbor. When the wind stopped, it cut its anchor rope, rose on its own, and now bombards the harbor from above.
5264	Rope Coil
